{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To catch a Pondling, you'll have wait for the right moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to a variety of special fishing locations for the chance to reel in one of the many different pattern, size and\u00a0colour combinations of Pondlings to collect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to upgrade your equipment to catch new, distinctive and valuable Pondlings or spend that money decorating your tank with special backgrounds, flooring and objects. Purchase Pond-Passes in-game to unlock access to many unique and exciting locations, each with their own native Pondling types to collect, sell or maybe even just to show off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Notice: Not all features listed will be currently present in any/all demo releases at any given time.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639710?t=1746184972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/67d52198799428f1e1fba29612465c9edac789d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746184972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/76bba3003153f1bf02206b1bab10468a0903fe6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746184972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/76bba3003153f1bf02206b1bab10468a0903fe6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746184972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To catch a Pondling, you'll have wait for the right moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to a variety of special fishing locations for the chance to reel in one of the many different pattern, size and\u00a0colour combinations of Pondlings to collect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to upgrade your equipment to catch new, distinctive and valuab